This release contains ModelAngelo 1.0.16 source and local CryoAtlas research
modifications. Upstream: https://github.com/3dem/model-angelo
The upstream MIT license is preserved in LICENSE. Third-party attribution
comments and scientific constants remain in their source files.

This is not an unmodified official ModelAngelo distribution. The CNN trainer,
dataset handling, logging, and runtime compatibility include local changes.
The original copied source directory had no Git metadata; a precise upstream
commit cannot be established from it. The official v1.0.16 source tag was
also inspected to document local changes. SHA256SUMS records release hashes.

The release excludes private launchers, credentials, experiment outputs,
datasets, checkpoint weights, duplicated historical CNN trainers, diagnostic
scripts, and the custom GNN training reproduction. GNN inference, chain
assembly, sequence assignment, CLI refinement, and model building are retained.
The unused standalone relaxation helper is excluded; CLI refinement uses
GNN inference and does not call that helper.

Relative to the pre-release cluster snapshot, this cleanup changes packaging,
portable launch interfaces, canonical CNN module paths, and documentation.
Retained numerical implementations are preserved. Local changes relative to
official ModelAngelo predate packaging and are summarized in README.md.
Required inference settings belong to the separately obtained weight bundle;
the unused package-level configuration and release-audit JSON were removed.
Pretrained weights are obtained under their distributors' terms.
